   "title": "East Coast Rail Link: homes demolished and flooded at Gombak",
   "place": "Kampung Sungai Chinchin and Desa Mukmin, Gombak Utara, Selangor, Malaysia",
   "iso3": "MYS",
   "lat": 3.241596,
