   ],
   "cp": [],
   "rg": "East Asia and the Pacific",
   "cx": [],
   "whole": "The railway was not carrying passengers in any source opened here. Malaysia's transport minister told Parliament in September 2023 that it was nearly 54% built and well placed to finish by 2027 (BenarNews), and passenger services were still scheduled for 2027 in July 2026 (New Straits Times). The two papers give the line's length differently: 655 km (BenarNews) and 665 km (New Straits Times). AidData's records put the drawn part of the credit at RM 19.69 billion by August 2018 and the renegotiated project cost at RM 44 billion. No measure of what the line delivers to Gombak was found.",
   "ct": [
    "tied",
    "repay"
   ]
